  "policy_id": "MP-2026-7",
  "version": 4,
  "effective_from": "2026-01-01",
  "rules": [
    "Unless a later rule says otherwise, for each field the value from the highest-ranked source in this policy's source ranking wins.",
    "A null value never wins; skip it and use the next-ranked source that has a value.",
    "A value whose most recent change in the change history was made by the customer beats a value whose most recent change was made by staff or an import, whatever the source ranking says. Only each field's most recent change counts; earlier changes do not.",
    "If both values were last changed by the customer, the later change date wins.",
    "Merge into the survivor named in the request and archive the other record with merged_into set to the survivor."
  ],
